    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a roguelike air hockey game where you must win matches to increase your stats, earn money by completing challenges, and purchase items in the store. You'll choose between two different types: passive and active, which you'll have to activate at the right time. Immerse yourself in the world of air hockey and defeat all the bosses without losing... or you'll have to start over.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a roguelike air hockey game where you must win matches to increase your stats, earn money by completing challenges, and purchase items in the store. You'll choose between two different types: passive and active, which you'll have to activate at the right time. Immerse yourself in the world of air hockey and defeat all the bosses without losing... or you'll have to start over.</p>",
    "short_description": "It's a retro roguelike with pixel art graphics mixed with Air hockey and RPG mechanics, with character stats you'll need to improve. Defeat exciting bosses, each with their own special ability, playing Air hockey.",
